 become very scarce and hard to find. The American were supplying the Okinawans with powdered milk among other items to help keep starvation low. And from those cans of food they would find a way to bring music back to the people again.<br><br>\n(Source: AniDB)", "startDate": {"year": 1989, "month": 8}, "endDate": {"year": 1989, "month": 8}, "season": "SUMMER", "seasonYear": 1989, "episodes": 1, "duration": 78, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Drama"], "tags": [{"name": "Historical", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 17893, "title": {"romaji": "Cheonbangjichuk Hani", "english": null}, "format": "TV", "description": "An alternative version of Dalyeolla Hani with minor changes implemented.\n<br><br>\nHani is a small tomboy and slightly troublesome teenager who lives life a bit carelessly on her own since her Father lives abroad due to work in the Middle East and her Mother died when she was very small. The only thing Hany is very good at is running~ fast!<br><br>\n\n(Source: Cute in Korea)", "startDate": {"year": 1989, "month": 7}, "endDate": {"year": 1989, "month": 9}, "season": null, "seasonYear": null, "episodes": 13, "duration": 25, "countryOfOrigin": "KR", "source": "MANGA", "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Sports"], "tags": [{"name": "School", "rank": 50, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Athletics", "rank": 20, "isAdult": false}]}, {"id": 18275, "title": {"romaji": "Mini Yon Soldier Rin!", "english": null}, "format": "OVA", "description": "A 1989 OVA about a boy saving the world from the evil scientist.", "startDate": {"year": 1989, "month": 11}, "endDate": {"year": 1989, "month": 11}, "season": "FALL", "seasonYear": 1989, "episodes": 1, "duration": 30, "countryOfOrigin": "JP", "source": null, "hashtag": null, "genres": ["Action", "Adventure", "Mecha", "Sports"], "tags": [{"name": "Cars", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Shounen", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false}, {"name": "Male Protagonist", "rank": 79, "isAdult": false},